~ initialize_local_variables

=> start

~ start
if Variables.get_var("0_1_death") == 1
	A frail fragment: You hear her rapidly approaching behind you. She catches up in an instant.
	A frail fragment: You feel her fingernails dig into your sides and her teeth bite into the back of your neck. 
	A frail fragment: She picks you up like you weigh nothing, and spins you around. Her smell is unbearable. 
	A frail fragment: As life seeps out of you, the last thing you see is her slimy eyes as she leans in for a kiss. 
	A frail fragment: As her lips touch yours, you die. 
	The screen is a close up of her eyes, unlocked achievement Joan's wrath - hidden ending 2, this ending soft locks you for now
	do DialogueFuncs.kill_player()
elif Variables.get_var("0_1_death") == 2
	A frail fragment: You see her leap at you with almost inhuman speed. 
	A frail fragment: Before you're able to react, she slashes your eyes with fingernails as sharp as knives. 
	A frail fragment: Unable to see anything anymore, you hear yourself scream in agony as you desperately try to get a hit in yourself. 
	A frail fragment: You feel a sharp pang of pain as she slashes again. And again. 
	A frail fragment: She then digs into your sides and picks you up like you weigh nothing. You feel her breath as she leans in. The smell is unbearable.
	A frail fragment: As her lips touch yours, you die. 
	Unlocked achievement Joan's wrath - hidden ending 2, this ending soft locks you for now
	do DialogueFuncs.kill_player()
	
	




